[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) merged every date report into one known issue. The cause rule and the desk notes do not describe one bug.

<Callout kind="warn">
The incident page still says one issue, and its parser count still includes the one-day reads. The split below gives each report one problem.
</Callout>

## The split

<ProblemSplit ticket={4471} />

A report is parser when the tenant writes the day first and the report did not come through booking-v3's form. It is hint when it did: that form tells people to type the month first, and the form reads the day first. A report the desk notes list as a one-day move stays in its own row, even when the cause rule would file it under the tenant.

